This plugin is an independent implementation inspired by the user-facing
features of PayneXie/astrbot_plugin_hextech:
https://github.com/PayneXie/astrbot_plugin_hextech

No source code or bundled data files from that project are included.

Champion data and game assets are loaded at runtime from Riot Games Data
Dragon. Augment definitions are loaded from CommunityDragon. Public ARAM:
Mayhem statistics are read from OP.GG server-rendered pages, optional mechanic
notes are read from the official League of Legends Wiki, and optional Chinese
aliases and image fallbacks use public gtimg resources. Those services, data,
names, and assets remain subject to their own terms and intellectual-property
policies.

Optional full-item routes are loaded at runtime from Mayhempedia:
https://github.com/boxsbraindump/Mayhempedia
Mayhempedia is distributed under the MIT License. Its route data is presented
as community-authored guidance and is not represented as OP.GG statistics.

